<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Reset Password Email</title>
  <style>
    body { 
      margin: 0; 
      background-color: #f3f4f6; 
      font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, sans-serif; 
      color: #374151; 
    }
    .container { 
      max-width: 520px; 
      margin: 40px auto; 
      background: #fff; 
      border-radius: 14px; 
      overflow: hidden; 
      box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); 
    }
    .header { 
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #2563eb, #3b82f6); 
      color: #fff; 
      text-align: center; 
      padding: 30px 20px; 
    }
    .header h2 { 
      margin: 0; 
      font-size: 22px; 
      font-weight: 600; 
    }
    .content { 
      padding: 30px; 
      line-height: 1.6; 
    }
    .content p { 
      margin: 10px 0; 
      font-size: 15px; 
    }
    .button { 
      display: inline-block; 
      padding: 12px 28px; 
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #2563eb, #3b82f6); 
      color: #fff; 
      text-decoration: none; 
      font-weight: 600; 
      border-radius: 8px; 
      margin: 20px 0; 
      transition: opacity 0.2s ease-in-out; 
    }
    .button:hover { 
      opacity: 0.9; 
    }
    .footer { 
      background-color: #f9fafb; 
      padding: 15px 20px; 
      font-size: 12px; 
      text-align: center; 
      color: #6b7280; 
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="header">
      <h2>Reset Your Password</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="content">
      <p>Hi there,</p>
      <p>We received a request to reset your password. Click the button below to set up a new one.</p>
<a href="http://localhost:5173/reset-password?token=<%= token %>" 
         style="display:inline-block; padding:12px 28px; 
                background:linear-gradient(135deg,#2563eb,#3b82f6); 
                color:#ffffff !important; text-decoration:none !important; 
                font-weight:600; border-radius:8px; font-size:15px; 
                margin:20px 0; transition:opacity 0.2s ease-in-out;">
        Reset Password
      </a>      <p>If you didn’t request this, you can safely ignore this email.</p>
      <p>Thanks,<br><strong>Article Post Team</strong></p>
    </div>
    <div class="footer">
      © 2025 Article Post. All rights reserved.
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
